title: Budget negotiations

= Budget negotiations

@bud_pnv
title: Budget talks: PNV
is-card: true
tags: sp_budget
view-if: seats_pnv > 0 and bdeal_pnv = 0

= Budget talks with PNV

PNV has [+ seats_pnv +] seats. Their price for voting yes: Investment in the Basque Country and the transfer of rail commuter services.

- @bud_pnv_yes: Pay the price
- @root: Refuse

@bud_pnv_yes
title: Deal with PNV
on-arrival: {! Q.fiscal_adj -= 0.05; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.budgetDeal(Q, 'pnv'); } !}

= A deal with PNV

PNV will vote for the budget.

@bud_erc
title: Budget talks: ERC
is-card: true
tags: sp_budget
view-if: seats_erc > 0 and bdeal_erc = 0

= Budget talks with ERC

ERC has [+ seats_erc +] seats. Their price for voting yes: A dialogue table on Catalonia and money for Rodalies trains.

- @bud_erc_yes: Pay the price
- @root: Refuse

@bud_erc_yes
title: Deal with ERC
on-arrival: {! Q.cat_dialogue += 1; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.budgetDeal(Q, 'erc'); } !}

= A deal with ERC

ERC will vote for the budget.

@bud_junts
title: Budget talks: Junts
is-card: true
tags: sp_budget
view-if: seats_junts > 0 and bdeal_junts = 0

= Budget talks with Junts

Junts has [+ seats_junts +] seats. Their price for voting yes: Powers over immigration and a Catalan quota of spending.

- @bud_junts_yes: Pay the price
- @root: Refuse

@bud_junts_yes
title: Deal with Junts
on-arrival: {! Q.cat_dialogue += 1; Q.sanchez_authority -= 2; if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.budgetDeal(Q, 'junts'); } !}

= A deal with Junts

Junts will vote for the budget.

